Rārangi ina-tae: ['tārua'] mahia: {
	>> tārua := Rārangi hou.
	whaiaro ia: { :tau :section
		tārua tāpiri-muri: section karanga-whaiaro tārua.
	}. <- tārua.
}.

>> sheep := Rārangi hou ; ['Dolly'] ; ['Shaun']. 
>> clones := sheep tārua.
clones ia: { :tau :sheep
	sheep tāpiri-muri: ['2'].
}.

Huaputa tuhi: sheep, rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: clones, rārangi-hou.
